---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<div class="card-blue not-prose">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 dark:text-gray-200">Team Leadership & Execution</h2>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 dark:text-gray-400">Led a team of <strong>7 engineers</strong> (1 Staff, 3 Senior, 2 Mid, 1 Junior) plus <strong>12+ cross-functional contributors</strong> across Design, Platform Infrastructure, and DevOps.</p>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
    <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-600/50 dark:bg-black/20">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 dark:text-gray-200">
        <Icon name="carbon:partnership" class="w-6 h-6 text-indigo-600" />
        Management Approach
      </h3>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-blue-600 mb-1">Autonomy with alignment</p>
          <p class="text-xs">Set clear outcomes and constraints, trusted engineers to own the "how"</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-green-600 mb-1">Strategic context</p>
          <p class="text-xs">Invited team to roadmap planning, stakeholder meetings, budget discussions</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-primary-600 mb-1">Multiplier opportunities</p>
          <p class="text-xs">Created chances to lead architecture reviews, mentoring, RFC processes</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-pink-600 mb-1">Recognition & growth</p>
          <p class="text-xs">Amplified wins to leadership, pushed for promotions with clear narratives</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-600/50 dark:bg-black/20">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 dark:text-gray-200">
        <Icon name="line-md:lightbulb" class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600" />
        Leadership in Action
      </h3>
      <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-blue-600 mb-1">Including Engineers in Business Decisions</p>
          <p class="text-xs">Included senior engineers early on in cost review meetings. They proposed the self-hosted solution because they understood the business constraint, which resulted in 86% cost reduction.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-green-600 mb-1">Driving Promotions Through Impact</p>
          <p class="text-xs">Mid-level engineer led CI/CD integration. I highlighted their work in VP review, wrote promotion case showing $480K annual savings from their automation. Secured promotion to Senior.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-primary-600 mb-1">Empowering Technical Leadership</p>
          <p class="text-xs"> Senior engineer ran weekly office hours and became the go-to expert, presented at engineering all-hands, and earned Staff promotion.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
    <div class="text-center p-4 card-green">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-1">4</div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 font-semibold dark:text-gray-400">Promotions in 18 months</p>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center p-4 card-blue">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-1">100%</div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 font-semibold dark:text-gray-400">Team retention</p>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center p-4 card-purple">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-1">3</div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 font-semibold dark:text-gray-400">Cross-functional teams coordinated</p>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center p-4 card-orange">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-orange-600 mb-1">24</div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 font-semibold dark:text-gray-400">Product teams enabled</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>